| **PE Valuation** | 2014-01 (synchronous) | ~8.3-9x, lowest in history |
| **Net profit growth** | 2014-full year (+1.4%) | Performance fundamentals have bottomed out simultaneously |
| **Rated Price** | 2014-Q2-Q3 (lag ~2 quarters) | Rated price bottoms out at 820-850 for about 1 year |
| **Dealer payment/advance payment** | 2014-Q3 (-83%, lag ~3 quarters) | Bottomed at the latest; **Posterior indicators** |
| **Ex-factory price** | The whole process is 819 yuan, stable and undiminished | The anchor of brand power |

**Key rules: stock price bottoms → performance bottoms → approval price bottoms → advance receipts bottom**, which has been misaligned for about half a year to a year.

